# UI

- Reuse the header, section, card, and button classes in `styles.css`.
- Every page has a title, a viewport meta tag, and a link back to the home page.
- Images have alt text. Controls and links have visible text.
- Keep text inside the card or column. Do not let a long title overflow.
- A layout change has to work on a narrow phone width and on a desktop window.
- Confirm store links point at the product named in that card.
